An item comment or attribute line closes the item's paragraph

````
::: note
- para
- %% c
```
code
::::
:::
after *b*
.
<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
  <ul>
    <li>para</li>
    <li></li>
  </ul>
  <pre><code>code
::::
:::
after *b*
</code></pre>
</aside>
````

